:: time-system [script nobr]
/*
  TIME SLOT SYSTEM
  ------------------------------------------------------------
  Time slots: MORNING, MIDDAY, AFTERNOON, EVENING, NIGHT.
  $timeSlot is initialized in StoryInit.tw; the basic
  <<advanceTime "SLOT">> widget lives in src/ui/widgets.tw.

  Reserved for day-content logic that needs more than a flat
  set   e.g. a canonical slot order + a <<nextTimeSlot>> widget
  that rolls over into the next day, or per-slot energy/stress
  drift. Add that here once the day-loop structure is decided.
*/

var TIME_SLOTS = ["MORNING", "MIDDAY", "AFTERNOON", "EVENING", "NIGHT"];
